OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial jurors told of
OL,4,A'selfie' evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of murdering a
OL,7,Fgrandfather took photographs of himself
OL,8,Fin the elderly man's flat, prosecutors
OL,9,Fhave suggested to a jury.
OL,11,FPolice found several "selfies" on John
OL,12,FMills' mobile phone when investigating
OL,13,F71-year-old John Boyle's death in
OL,14,FKettering, Northamptonshire, jurors at
OL,15,FNorthampton Crown Court were told.
OL,17,FFinger-marks matching Mills'
OL,18,Ffingerprints were also found in 19
OL,19,Fareas of Boyle's ground-floor flat in
OL,20,FLeatherland Court, Kettering, jurors
OL,21,Fwere told.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
