OL,3,GNEWSAMurder trial jurors told of
OL,4,A'selfie' evidence
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors say Boyle, who was known as
OL,7,F"Sean" rather than John, was beaten to
OL,8,Fdeath while in bed at home on 26
OL,9,FOctober 2025. Mills, 46, denies murder.
